## Summary

In this iteration, I completed the following atomic task from Phase 2 - Organizations:

### Created
1. **`/org/ny.html`** - Organization creation page
2. **`org-create.js`** - Organization creation component with:
   - Form for name and slug (kortnavn)
   - Auto-generated slug from name (Norwegian character handling for æ, ø, å)
   - Client-side validation (slug format: lowercase, numbers, hyphens only)
   - Server-side error handling (duplicates, permissions)
